TI  - Microstructural Alteration of Lumbosacral Nerve Roots in Chronic Inflammatory Demyelinating Polyradiculoneuropathy: Insights From DTI and Correlations with Electrophysiological Parameters
PY  - 2022
T2  - Academic Radiology
VL  - 29
SP  - S175
EP  - S182
