TI  - Developing an AI-empowered head-only ultra-high-performance gradient MRI system for high spatiotemporal neuroimaging
PY  - 2024
T2  - NeuroImage
VL  - 290
C7  - 120553
DO  - 10.1016/j.neuroimage.2024.120553
