TI  - Can imaging be the new yardstick for diagnosing peripheral neuropathy?—a comparison between high resolution ultrasound and MR neurography with an approach to diagnosis
PY  - 2019
T2  - Insights into Imaging
VL  - 10
IS  - 1
C7  - 104
