TI  - Diffusion tensor imaging MR Neurography detects polyneuropathy in type 2 diabetes
PY  - 2020
T2  - Journal of Diabetes and its Complications
VL  - 34
IS  - 2
C7  - 107439
DO  - 10.1016/j.jdiacomp.2019.107439
